# Real env files. `*.local` above does not cover these, and once someone
# creates a .env.production for PUBLIC_BASE_PATH it would otherwise be picked
# up by `git add .` and committed. The example stays tracked, since it is the
# documented template and contains no values.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
